    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your bond with your wildfire spirit strengthens your destructive and restorative spells. Whenever you cast a spell that deals Fire damage or restores Hit Points while your spirit is summoned, roll a d8 and add the number rolled to one damage or healing roll of the spell. In addition, when you cast a spell with a range other than Self, it can originate from you or from your spirit.</p>",
